{"id":"e91c9293879d253e","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-veblen-closure-predicate.md","title":"Veblen 二元闭包与历史别名","display":"df-veblen-closure-predicate — Veblen 二元闭包与历史别名","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-veblen-closure-predicate","aliases":["18-df-veblen-closure-predicate","18-df-051"],"display":"df-veblen-closure-predicate — Veblen 二元闭包与历史别名","depends_on":["[[18-df-veblen-hierarchy]]","[[18-df-strongly-critical-ordinal]]"],"source_edition":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_section":"Lemma 3.4.13 (local compatibility alias)","source_pages":"39","source_pdf_pages":"49","verification_status":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-veblen-closure-predicate"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-veblen-closure-predicate</span><span>18-df-051</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-veblen-closure-predicate — Veblen 二元闭包与历史别名"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"40176d5c80238174\" href=\"?note=40176d5c80238174\" title=\"18-df-veblen-hierarchy\">18-df-veblen-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"76bd927de48a9849\" href=\"?note=76bd927de48a9849\" title=\"18-df-strongly-critical-ordinal\">18-df-strongly-critical-ordinal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Lemma 3.4.13 (local compatibility alias)"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"39"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"49"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SC}\">\\(\\mathrm{SC}\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"40176d5c80238174\" href=\"?note=40176d5c80238174\" title=\"18-df-veblen-hierarchy\">18-df-veblen-hierarchy</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"76bd927de48a9849\" href=\"?note=76bd927de48a9849\" title=\"18-df-strongly-critical-ordinal\">18-df-strongly-critical-ordinal</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AutonomousOrd}\">\\(\\mathrm{AutonomousOrd}\\)</span> 为保留旧链接的本地谓词名。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AutonomousOrd}(\\gamma)\\ \\leftrightarrow\\\n0&lt;\\gamma\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta&lt;\\gamma\\;\\varphi_\\alpha(\\beta)&lt;\\gamma.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{AutonomousOrd}(\\gamma)\\ \\leftrightarrow\\\n0&lt;\\gamma\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta&lt;\\gamma\\;\\varphi_\\alpha(\\beta)&lt;\\gamma.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;(\\mathrm{AutonomousOrd}(\\gamma)\\leftrightarrow\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{SC}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;(\\mathrm{AutonomousOrd}(\\gamma)\\leftrightarrow\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{SC}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>旧名 AutonomousOrd 实际写的是强临界/Veblen 二元闭包，不能冒充 §8.3.2 的自主闭包 Aut(α)。加入 0&lt;γ 排除空域真值导致 AutonomousOrd(0) 成立的退化。等价性对应 Lemma 3.4.13；反向论证按原书用 Veblen 标准表示和对 ξ&lt;φ_γ(0) 的归纳。本节点不定义自主可达性的概念。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-veblen-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"40176d5c80238174","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-veblen-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-strongly-critical-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"76bd927de48a9849","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-strongly-critical-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-veblen-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"40176d5c80238174","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$，$\\varphi$ 与 $\\mathrm{SC}$ 分别见 [[18-df-veblen-hierarchy]]、[[18-df-strongly-critical-ordinal]]。$\\mathrm{AutonomousOrd}$ 为保留旧链接的本地谓词名。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-strongly-critical-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"76bd927de48a9849","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$，$\\varphi$ 与 $\\mathrm{SC}$ 分别见 [[18-df-veblen-hierarchy]]、[[18-df-strongly-critical-ordinal]]。$\\mathrm{AutonomousOrd}$ 为保留旧链接的本地谓词名。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AutonomousOrd}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AutonomousOrd}(\\gamma)\\ \\leftrightarrow\\\n0<\\gamma\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta<\\gamma\\;\\varphi_\\alpha(\\beta)<\\gamma.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;(\\mathrm{AutonomousOrd}(\\gamma)\\leftrightarrow\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{SC}).","display":true}],"bytes":1471,"backlinks":[{"id":"3df370596a981512","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Gamma_\\alpha$ 为 [[18-df-strongly-critical-ordinal]] 的 SC 递增枚举；$\\mathrm{AutonomousOrd}$ 是 [[18-df-veblen-closure-predicate]] 中强临界性的历史别名。"},{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-57","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-veblen-closure-predicate]]"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-29","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-veblen-closure-predicate]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-112","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-veblen-closure-predicate]]"}],"outgoing":["40176d5c80238174","76bd927de48a9849"]}